# Hundred million command capacity preparation in standard Brainfuck
# Generic raw byte run transport no Brainfuck parsing outside this program
# Input mode zero means counts only mode one also emits bracket records
# Each run contains four length bytes and one raw byte
# A zero run length terminates the stream
# All integers are little endian and use four bytes
# Compiler core counts only the eight standard Brainfuck instructions
# Unmatched closing loops set status one
# Count overflow sets status two
# Final output has four count bytes four depth bytes and one status byte
# Optional records are one bracket byte followed by four position bytes
# The program never allocates a source sized tape buffer
# The external byte compressor is transport only and must preserve raw bytes
